  "description": "A robust implementation of an immutable singly-linked list in Rust, leveraging reference counting for efficient structural sharing. It provides common functional programming primitives such as head, tail, and prepend operations while ensuring memory safety through a manual iterative Drop implementation to prevent stack overflow on deep list structures.",
